:: day-1_library_hub [nobr]
<<locationImage "grand_library" "Grand Library">>
<h2>📚 Grand Library</h2>
<p>Three stories of answers. Some of them might even be useful today.</p>

<<completeObjective "library_vaelin">>

<<if $d2_npc_vaelin and not $d1_npc_vaelin2>>
<div class="interaction-card side">
  <<npcPortrait "vaelin" "Brother Vaelin">>
  <h4>📿 Brother Vaelin's Book Fortress</h4>
  <p>It's grown since yesterday. He may not have moved. He may not have slept.</p>
  [[Approach|day-1_npc_vaelin2]]
</div>
<</if>>

<<if not $d1_npc_haeth>>
<div class="interaction-card side">
  <<npcPortrait "haeth" "Haeth">>
  <h4>📖 Haeth at His Desk</h4>
  <p>He hasn't moved either. He never really does.</p>
  [[Speak with him|day-1_npc_haeth]]
</div>
<</if>>

<<if (not $d2_npc_vaelin or $d1_npc_vaelin2) and $d1_npc_haeth>>
  <p class="empty-note">The library holds its usual hush. The constellations turn slowly on the ceiling.</p>
<</if>>

<div class="nav-return">
  [[← Return to Palace Hub|day-1_hub]]
</div>
